--- `str.is_empty` — part of `str-handl`, the pure-Handl `str` implementation over `char`.

--- Whether `s` is the empty string.
---
--- @param {s} - the input string
--- @returns {Bool - `true` iff `s == ""`}
--- @example
--- `str.is_empty("")`
--- -- => true
---
export is_empty := (s) ~> do {
  s == ""
}
